  "description": {
    "text": "The EX Trainer Kit, released in June 2004 in English, French, German and Italian only, taught the game with two 30-card half decks, Latias and Latios, together with a starter and an intermediate rule book, a playmat, damage and status counters, a coin and an EX booster pack. Each half deck's cards carry the kit's own set symbol and number and no rarity mark.\n\nThe Latias half deck runs on Fire Energy and holds ten different cards, 1/10 to 10/10, reprinted from EX Ruby & Sapphire, EX Sandstorm and EX Dragon. The exception is the holo Latias, until then a Japanese promotional card.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: EX Trainer Kit (TCG) (Wayback Machine copy, 20 August 2026)",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20260820223102/https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/EX_Trainer_Kit_(TCG)"
      }
    ]
  },
  "tell": {
    "text": "The Latias half-deck symbol, and a number out of 10",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: EX Trainer Kit (TCG) (Wayback Machine copy, 20 August 2026)",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20260820223102/https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/EX_Trainer_Kit_(TCG)"
      }
    ]
  },
